pe of fabric filter bag made from nylon (polyamide) material. These bags are known for their durability, chemical resistance, and versatility. They are widely used in various industrial applications for liquid filtration, rather than air filtration, where their unique properties are particularly beneficial.<\/p><h3>Features of Nylon Filter Bags<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Mechanical Properties<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Nylon (Polyamide): Known for its strong mechanical properties, abrasion resistance, and good chemical compatibility with many substances.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Filtration Efficiency<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Micron Ratings: Nylon filter bags come in various micron ratings, typically ranging from 1 to 200 microns, allowing for precise filtration levels according to the application needs.<br \/>Durability:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Strength<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Nylon is a tough material that can withstand high-pressure conditions and is less likely to tear or break compared to other filter materials.<br \/>Temperature Resistance: Nylon can generally handle temperatures up to around 120\u00b0C (248\u00b0F), making it suitable for a variety of industrial processes.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Compatibility: Nylon filter bags are resistant to many chemicals, including oils, hydrocarbons, and organic solvents, though they may not be suitable for strong acids or alkalis.<\/p><h3>Choose Philite\u00ae<\/h3><p>Philite\u00ae nylon monofilament filter bags are made of woven fabric. Monofilament mesh filter bags have super strength and wear resistance, no fiber shedding, and have uniform pore size. With its excellent performance and wide applicability, it has become an important tool in the field of industrial filtration.<\/p><ul><li><strong>High-quality material<\/strong>: high-quality nylon monofilament, high toughness, multiple mesh options to choose from.<\/li><li><strong>Fine processing<\/strong>: It adopts three-needle and five-thread industrial sewing technology, and uses high-strength sewing thread to thicken the edge, which is strong and reliable.<\/li><li><strong>Bag top options<\/strong>: There are a variety of rings to choose from, including stainless steel rings and plastic rings.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f79a951 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f79a951\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c919a8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2c919a8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2559\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Plastic-Ring-Nylon-Filter-Bags-detail2-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Plastic Ring<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a8ba11 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7a8ba11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" h